# Chain selection fixture. Author chains A, B, AA and a (chain IDs are
# case-sensitive); the HEM ligand belongs to author chain A but has its own
# label_asym_id C. Model 2 matches model 1 only within chains A, AA and a
# (chain B lacks an atom), so model 2 is a frame only when B is not selected.
